  "name": "orb.farm",
  "description": "A high-performance cellular automata engine that simulates a closed ecosystem using Rust and WebAssembly for biological logic and WebGL for real-time rendering. The simulation models complex trophic interactions, nutrient cycling, and atmospheric gas exchange (O2/CO2) between diverse species including autotrophs, consumers, and decomposers. It utilizes a custom 'SandApi' for stochastic cell updates and a stack-based undo system for state management.",
